# Build context for the API image (context = repo root).
#
# Everything below is either a local build artifact, a secret, or something the image does
# not need - keeping it out shrinks the context and, more importantly, stops a stale local
# bin/obj from leaking into the container build.

# ----- .NET build output ----------------------------------------------------
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/artifacts/
**/TestResults/
**/*.user

# ----- Secrets & local config -----------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
**/appsettings.*.local.json

# ----- Frontend (built by its own Dockerfiles, from its own context) ---------
src/Frontend/

# ----- VCS, tooling & editor state ------------------------------------------
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
.claude/
**/.DS_Store

# ----- Docs & API scratch files ---------------------------------------------
docs/
bruno/
*.md
LICENSE*
Makefile
docker-compose*.yml
